    owl:sameAs <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/intendedAudience> ;
    skos:definition "Relates a work to the class of user for which the content of a resource is intended, or for whom the content is considered suitable."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "The class of user is defined by age group (e.g., children, young adults, adults), educational level (e.g., primary, secondary), type of disability, or another categorization."@en .

